{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51439","headline":"题铜官山庙（灵佑王祠在铜官山） · 裴休","name":"题铜官山庙（灵佑王祠在铜官山）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浔阳贤太守，遗庙古溪边。\n树影入流水，石门当洞天。\n幡花凝宝座，香案俨炉烟。\n若到千年後，重修事宛然。\n（《嘉靖铜陵县志》八、又《嘉靖池州府志》五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}